# Runtime dependencies for the AmneziaWG Web UI: what we choose, edited by hand.
#
# Flask serves the panel (live updates are Server-Sent Events, outbound HTTPS is the
# standard library's); cryptography reads devices' handshake initiations
# (services/initiation.py: X25519, ChaCha20-Poly1305). requirements.txt is generated
# from this file and pins every package these bring, so the image and the tests run
# the same versions and a rebuild never changes one by itself. Never edit
# requirements.txt by hand; bump with (DEVELOPMENT.md §11):
#
#   uv pip compile web-ui/requirements.in -o web-ui/requirements.txt \
#       --python-version 3.14 --python-platform linux --upgrade
#
# (--upgrade-package <name> for one; without either, the existing pins are kept.)
flask
cryptography
